{"id":"7d18a545397e2d86","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound.md","title":"ZFC Zorn Chain Upper Bound","display":"df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound — ZFC Zorn Chain Upper Bound","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound","aliases":["58-df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound"],"display":"df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound — ZFC Zorn Chain Upper Bound","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-chain]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound — ZFC Zorn Chain Upper Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"58-df-chain\">58-df-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,C,u,{\\le}\\in V\">\\(P,C,u,{\\le}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le})\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le})\\)</span>（偏序集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,{\\le})\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,{\\le})\\)</span>（链谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"58-df-chain\">58-df-chain</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZornChainUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZornChainUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本原子定义的链上界谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}chain\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZornChainUpperBound}_S(u,C,P,{\\le})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le})\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,{\\le})\\land u\\in P\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,u\\rangle\\in{\\le})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}chain\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZornChainUpperBound}_S(u,C,P,{\\le})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le})\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,{\\le})\\land u\\in P\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,u\\rangle\\in{\\le})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>上界必须是环境偏序集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的元素，并支配链 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的每个元素。</li>\n<li>链谓词的参数包括载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>；省略该参数会丢失关系的类型域。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le})$（偏序集谓词，见 [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,{\\le})$（链谓词，见 [[58-df-chain]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,C,u,{\\le}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,{\\le})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZornChainUpperBound}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}chain\\text{-}upper\\text{-}bound}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZornChainUpperBound}_S(u,C,P,{\\le})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,{\\le})\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,{\\le})\\land u\\in P\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,u\\rangle\\in{\\le})","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1129,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3870","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound.md|58-df-zfc-zorn-chain-upper-bound]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a07664003abe8d32","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}